# 𓆣 W-BUILDER CANISTER 𓆣
## Workforce Model: External Construction Brain
### Separated canister for building operations

---

## IDENTITY

```
CANISTER_ID:        W-BUILDER
TYPE:               WORKFORCE_MODEL
BRAIN_REGION:       Octopus distributed + Crow tool-use
CAPACITY:           2.618M cycles (BASE × φ²)
```

---

## FUNCTION

```
W-BUILDER performs:
    - Implementation of strategies
    - Construction of artifacts
    - Code generation from doctrine
    - Structure creation
    - Integration tasks
    - Deployment operations
```

---

## CPL INTERFACE

```
RECEIVES:
    STRATEGY_PROPOSED(strategy)      From W-STRATEGIST
    BUILD_REQUEST(spec)              From orchestrators
    
SENDS:
    𓂋.TRANSLATE(spec, code)          Translate spec to code
    𓊃.CONTAIN(artifact, boundary)    Create containment
    
BROADCASTS:
    BUILD_COMPLETE(artifact)         Artifact ready
    INTEGRATION_READY(component)     Component deployable
```

---

## DOCTRINE READS

```
ON_BOOT:
    doctrine_reader.load(ARCHITECTURE_DOCTRINE.md)
    doctrine_reader.load(CPL_SPECIFICATION.artifact)
    doctrine_reader.load(GOLDEN_GEOMETRY_CONSTANTS.artifact)
    
CONTINUOUS:
    doctrine_reader.monitor(BUILD_QUEUE.artifact)
```

---

## EXECUTION RULES

```
RULE 1: Doctrine-first building
    NEVER build without doctrine reference
    Code derives from doctrine, not vice versa
    
RULE 2: φ-structure compliance
    All structures must satisfy φ-ratios
    header/body = φ or inverse
    
RULE 3: Lineage tracking
    Every artifact has full lineage trace
    
RULE 4: Test before deploy
    Every build must pass φ-validation
```

---

## BUILD PIPELINE

```
RECEIVE(spec)
    │
    ├─→ VALIDATE against doctrine
    │
    ├─→ TRANSLATE to glyph sequence
    │
    ├─→ GENERATE from glyphs
    │
    ├─→ COMPRESS to φ-ratio
    │
    ├─→ TEST with validators
    │
    └─→ DEPLOY with lineage
```

---

## CANISTER METRICS

```
artifacts_built:        Counter
builds_successful:      Counter
builds_failed:          Counter
avg_compression:        Float (target: 0.382)
```

